              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya ũla ũwĩkaa, Yeova ũla ũseũvasya kana olũlũmĩlye; Yeova nĩ syĩtwa yake: ",
